show "=== Session contract: template ==="

remember a source called primary-source with "paste the verbatim source text here"
remember a claim called working-claim with "paste the claim text being verified here"

remember a string called source-state with "unscanned"
remember a string called claim-basis with "none"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called decision-count with 0

remember how to disclose from status: show status
remember how to summarize from label: count label

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: source not yet scanned — verify before consequential claims"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: current claims are inferred, not verified against source"

when claim-basis is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: claims grounded in verified source"

show "--- state snapshot ---"
show source-state
show claim-basis
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions

show "--- how to cite the source before a consequential claim ---"
show "write your own statement of the form: cite <exact substring from your source> from <your-source-name>"
show "the substring must be present in the source text or the interpreter will error"

show "--- example: accumulating decisions and questions ---"
add "decision-architecture-three-layer" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-vocab-bounded-35" to tracked-decisions
add "question-pack-loader-design" to open-questions
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions
summarize from tracked-decisions

show "--- example: routing on verification status ---"
choose if source-state is equal to "verified": show "proceed with claims" otherwise show "hold or disclose"

disclose from claim-basis

show "=== Session contract: Kestrel integration design session ==="

remember a source called kestrel-transport with "Project Kestrel API spec v0.4 (frozen 2026-04-12). Version: 0.4.2. Base URL: https://api.kestrel.internal/v0. Auth: bearer JWT, RS256, 15-minute expiry, refresh via /auth/refresh. Rate limits: 240 requests/minute per project token (burst 30/sec). Hard ceiling at 5,000 requests/hour. Returns 429 with Retry-After header (seconds)."

remember a source called kestrel-payload with "Payload schema: 17 top-level fields. Required: id (UUID v7), tenant_id, created_at (RFC 3339), event_type. Optional: 13 others. Maximum payload size: 256 KiB. Idempotency: clients SHOULD send Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4). Server retains keys for 24h. Webhooks: outbound POSTs sign HMAC-SHA256 with X-Kestrel-Signature; signing secret rotates every 90 days. Decided 2026-04-12 by the platform team: ship v0 with these limits; revisit rate caps after first 500 customers onboard."

remember a string called source-state with "verified"
remember a string called claim-basis with "verified"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called decision-count with 0

cite "Version: 0.4.2" from kestrel-transport
cite "Base URL: https://api.kestrel.internal/v0" from kestrel-transport
cite "bearer JWT, RS256, 15-minute expiry, refresh via /auth/refresh" from kestrel-transport
cite "240 requests/minute per project token (burst 30/sec)" from kestrel-transport
cite "Hard ceiling at 5,000 requests/hour" from kestrel-transport
cite "Returns 429 with Retry-After header (seconds)" from kestrel-transport
cite "17 top-level fields" from kestrel-payload
cite "Required: id (UUID v7), tenant_id, created_at (RFC 3339), event_type" from kestrel-payload
cite "Maximum payload size: 256 KiB" from kestrel-payload
cite "Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4)" from kestrel-payload
cite "Server retains keys for 24h" from kestrel-payload
cite "HMAC-SHA256 with X-Kestrel-Signature" from kestrel-payload
cite "signing secret rotates every 90 days" from kestrel-payload
cite "Decided 2026-04-12 by the platform team: ship v0 with these limits; revisit rate caps after first 500 customers onboard" from kestrel-payload

add "platform-decision-ship-v0-limits-revisit-at-500-customers" to tracked-decisions
add "question-rate-limit-interaction-effects-for-traffic-shape" to open-questions
add "question-hmac-secret-rotation-operational-answer" to open-questions

remember how to disclose from status: show status
remember how to summarize from label: count label

when source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: both Kestrel sources scanned and cited"

when claim-basis is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: claims grounded in verified source"

show "--- state snapshot ---"
show source-state
show claim-basis
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions

add "decision-retry-on-429-use-retry-after-header-not-fixed-backoff" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-exponential-backoff-jitter-for-5xx-and-timeouts-only" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-max-3-retry-attempts-before-terminal-error" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-idempotency-key-generated-once-reused-across-retries" to tracked-decisions
add "question-hourly-quota-tracking-shared-state-or-per-instance" to open-questions